{"item": "01KS2FT7Z0PK0DTQAFR1JNG412", "type": "note", "split": "test", "group": "note", "text": "\n# Janela de importação\n\nA importação roda de madrugada, às 03:00.\n\n## Passos\n\n1. Pausar o cron do importer.\n2. Esperar os lotes terminarem.\n3. Reabrir `/srv/beta/inbox` para novos arquivos.\n", "gold": [], "decoys": [], "evidence_sets": [], "verdict": "valid", "reason": null, "resolution": null, "reviewer": "fixture"}
{"item": "01KG7TZDX0XPPTK6KPTBWTREZ2", "type": "note", "split": "test", "group": "note", "text": "\n# Conveyor is now importer\n\nConveyor, the old name of the importer, was retired in January. Old cron entries still say Conveyor.\n", "gold": [], "decoys": [], "evidence_sets": [], "verdict": "valid", "reason": null, "resolution": null, "reviewer": "fixture"}
{"item": "01KG0EYAP0K7JQTSB9FZP0SEK3", "type": "note", "split": "dev", "group": "note", "text": "\n# Lantern is now edge-cache\n\nLantern, the old name of edge-cache, was dropped in January. Older dashboards and runbooks still say Lantern.\n", "gold": [], "decoys": [], "evidence_sets": [], "verdict": "valid", "reason": null, "resolution": null, "reviewer": "fixture"}
{"item": "01KQYV45J06MQ9V9QDA072PQ9W", "type": "note", "split": "test", "group": "note", "text": "\n# Batch size lowered\n\nThis replaces decision-batch-size. Large batches collided, so `import.batch_rows` is now 50.\n", "gold": [], "decoys": [], "evidence_sets": [], "verdict": "valid", "reason": null, "resolution": null, "reviewer": "fixture"}
{"item": "01KQN4ZVE0X5JWFRMKMR7SED1B", "type": "note", "split": "test", "group": "note", "text": "\n# importer fails when two imports overlap\n\nOverlapping imports stop with `ERR_ROW_LOCK` on the orders table.\n\n## Fix\n\nTake the advisory lock first: `SELECT pg_advisory_lock(42)`.\n", "gold": [], "decoys": [], "evidence_sets": [], "verdict": "valid", "reason": null, "resolution": null, "reviewer": "fixture"}
{"item": "01KJQAY9E0BYM53HXXV4506TQP", "type": "note", "split": "dev", "group": "note", "text": "\n# Retry limit for the sync worker\n\nThe sync worker retries a failed push 3 times before it gives up.\n\n## Setting\n\n`sync.max_retries = 3` in `/etc/alpha/sync.toml`.\n", "gold": [], "decoys": [], "evidence_sets": [], "verdict": "valid", "reason": null, "resolution": null, "reviewer": "fixture"}
{"item": "01KPP32E001CXHGCTYMYW7R80C", "type": "note", "split": "dev", "group": "note", "text": "\n# Retry limit raised\n\nThis replaces decision-retry-limit. Pushes were failing during short outages, so `sync.max_retries` is now 5.\n", "gold": [], "decoys": [], "evidence_sets": [], "verdict": "valid", "reason": null, "resolution": null, "reviewer": "fixture"}
{"item": "01KHE3S540Q9DKZBNE4VKT4FHF", "type": "note", "split": "test", "group": "note", "text": "\n# importer folders\n\nThe importer reads files from `/srv/beta/inbox` and moves finished ones to `/srv/beta/done`.\n", "gold": [], "decoys": [], "evidence_sets": [], "verdict": "valid", "reason": null, "resolution": null, "reviewer": "fixture"}
{"item": "01KM0DBEF0FH2PWDT59CHH4W9A", "type": "note", "split": "dev", "group": "note", "text": "\n# edge-cache drops every entry under memory pressure\n\nWhen the resident size passes 900 MB the cache evicts everything at once and logs `ERR_EVICT_STORM`.\n\n## Fix\n\nSet `cache.high_water = 700MB` so eviction starts early and stays gradual.\n", "gold": [], "decoys": [], "evidence_sets": [], "verdict": "valid", "reason": null, "resolution": null, "reviewer": "fixture"}
{"item": "01KH6954G0Q30DRTVPAXTEB190", "type": "note", "split": "test", "group": "note", "text": "\n# Batch size for the importer\n\nThe importer loads rows in batches of 200.\n\n## Setting\n\n`import.batch_rows = 200`.\n", "gold": [], "decoys": [], "evidence_sets": [], "verdict": "valid", "reason": null, "resolution": null, "reviewer": "fixture"}
{"item": "01KRE0BGJ00TBN9E758M021ZV5", "type": "note", "split": "dev", "group": "note", "text": "\n# Plano de migração do cache\n\nNa sexta o cache vai para o novo cluster.\n\n## Passos\n\n1. Congelar as escritas no edge-cache.\n2. Copiar o snapshot para o novo cluster.\n3. Reabrir a porta 7422 e liberar as escritas.\n", "gold": [], "decoys": [], "evidence_sets": [], "verdict": "valid", "reason": null, "resolution": null, "reviewer": "fixture"}
{"item": "01KM649AP0FB8A6G5FC1V5PYH9", "type": "note", "split": "dev", "group": "note", "text": "\n# edge-cache ports\n\nThe admin socket listens on 7421. The data socket listens on 7422.\n", "gold": [], "decoys": [], "evidence_sets": [], "verdict": "valid", "reason": null, "resolution": null, "reviewer": "fixture"}
